{"version":1,"content":"<p>隨着人工智能產業快速發展，全球數據中心對電力的需求正以前所未有的速度攀升。為滿足未來算力基礎設施的能源需求，Google宣佈與美國地熱能源企業 Quaise Energy 達成一項具有裏程碑意義的合作協議，將採購來自超高温巖石地熱發電項目的50兆瓦連續電力，為其數據中心運營提供穩定能源。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586880.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:26:51.199744+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:58:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.289037+00:00","content_hash":"da69f1beec86161e25f99abd2faf5425c8d1e66af4d16429af35f94d4d6aeb6d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}